  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1304.04 Type of Warning Buoy",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1304.04 Type of Warning Buoy. The buoy used to warn of a restricted use area shall:\n\n(a) Be a standard state danger buoy;\n\n(b) Be white and international orange in color;\n\n(c) Have an orange diamond symbol with an X through it; and\n\n(d) Read as follows: “Restricted Use Area, pursuant to RSA 487. NH Dept. of Environmental Services 603-271-3503.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300) #8703-A, eff 9-5-06; ss by #10696, eff 10-18-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300); ss by #14186, eff 1-25-25",
